Third-party software used by this sample

None of the software below is copied into this folder. It is downloaded or provided by the AWS service
when you run the steps in README.md. Each project is under its own license.

| Component | Used for | License |
|---|---|---|
| DuckDB 2.0.0 (https://duckdb.org) and its httpfs, aws, avro, iceberg and tpcds extensions | Query engine, Iceberg reads, data generation | MIT |
| venv-pack 0.2.0 (https://github.com/jcrist/venv-pack) | Packaging the DuckDB Python environment | BSD |
| boto3 1.43.123 (https://github.com/boto/boto3) | EMR Serverless and S3 API calls from the runner | Apache-2.0 |
| Apache Spark and Apache Iceberg (provided by Amazon EMR Serverless) | Spark SQL baseline, Iceberg tables | Apache-2.0 |
| TPC-DS data and queries (https://www.tpc.org/tpcds/), generated by the DuckDB tpcds extension and the AWS public dataset | Benchmark workload | TPC End User License Agreement |

